. * ==============================================================================
. * 2. Estimate spillovers for CNKI publication outcomes
. * ==============================================================================
. 
. use ${c -(}RUN5_STATA_CNKI{c )-}CNKI_DID.dta, clear
{txt}
{com}. drop if 所属行业=="-" | 所属行业==""
{txt}(723,281 observations deleted)

{com}. * The original CNKI industry field is used for peer grouping.
. 
. * Construct CNKI publication-based firm-size categories.
. bys firm_id: egen size = sum (pub_num)
{txt}
{com}. 
. gen size_category = 0
{txt}
{com}. replace size_category=1 if size==0 //0-25%
{txt}(0 real changes made)

{com}. replace size_category=2 if size==1 //25%-50%
{txt}(810,992 real changes made)

{com}. replace size_category=3 if size==2|size==3 //50%-75%
{txt}(349,570 real changes made)

{com}. replace size_category=4 if size>=4 //75%-100%
{txt}(292,604 real changes made)

{com}. 
. 
. bys 所属行业 size_category year: egen did_spillover = max(did) // considering spillover effect
{txt}
{com}. drop if entity_list==1 // drop original treatment group
{txt}(5,668 observations deleted)

{com}. 
. 
. * Estimate the level outcome using linear fixed effects.
. reghdfe pub_num_w did_spillover, absorb(firm_id year) vce(r)
{res}{txt}({browse "http://scorreia.com/research/hdfe.pdf":MWFE estimator} converged in 2 iterations)
{res}
